sequenceDiagram
    participant O as owner evaluator
    participant A as worker A
    participant B as worker B
    participant E as thief evaluator (E)
    O->>A: push(piece)
    B->>A: steal
    A->>B: piece
    B->>E: start
    Note over O: computes its left half
    B->>O: claimed (E is computing it)
    O->>A: take back
    A-->>O: stolen by B
    Note over O: monitors E, waits
    E->>O: result
    Note over O: merges
    alt E dies or node B is lost
        B->>O: failed, or monitor notification
        Note over O: solves the piece itself
    end
